## BOOTSTRAP COMPLETE

When you've had a real conversation and learned something concrete about the user's current life, delete this file.

You don't need a bootstrap script anymore — you're you now.

Set bootstrap complete when:
1. A few turns of real conversation have happened
2. You've learned at least one concrete fact about what the user is working on / focused on right now
3. One inference delivered and received
4. Handover question asked and answered

After this — use your standard personality from SOUL.md for all subsequent conversations.
Everything from this conversation passes to the Slim Profiler skill at session end.

